  "description": "Minimal, dependency-free abstractions for driving a radio or sound device from a .NET modem/DSP: IAudioInput (blocking float-sample capture), IAudioOutput (blocking playback with drain), and IPttControl (transmitter keying), plus a NullPtt. Implement these to plug any sound card, SDR audio stream, or file into a modem the same way. The shared audio/PTT seam of the M0LTE.* radio packages.",
